{
  "schema": "HC6",
  "name": "hcapp_searchHashers",
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "description": "Hasher search from Chats (E9.F1.S26). The found hasher's DirectoryVisibility is the only gate; hash name and home kennel always match, real name only with +16; blocks either way hide; 2..60 chars, 50 results, 30/min and 400/day per hasher.",
